    {"page": 1, "start": 31, "end": 61, "top": 85.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 201.0, "baseline": 96.02, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "estuary twice before the tide "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 61, "end": 88, "top": 99.0, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 192.6, "baseline": 109.46, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "turns, carrying commuters, "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 88, "end": 111, "top": 112.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 166.8, "baseline": 122.93, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "bicycles and crates of "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 111, "end": 140, "top": 126.0, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 203.4, "baseline": 136.37, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "vegetables from the farms on "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 140, "end": 243, "top": 139.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 528.0, "baseline": 149.81, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "the far shore. Nobody on board hurries; they read, drink tea from flasks and watch the herons stand in "},
