    {"page": 1, "start": 347, "end": 368, "top": 166.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 161.4, "baseline": 176.69, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "with practised ease.\u000d"},
    {"page": 1, "start": 368, "end": 470, "top": 185.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 540.0, "baseline": 196.13, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "A well-made map leaves out far more than it shows. The cartographer decides which roads matter, which "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 470, "end": 575, "top": 198.6, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 526.8, "baseline": 209.35, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "rivers deserve a name and where a label may sit without hiding a village. Every choice trades detail for "},
